    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, a borescope takes like 4-6 hours min and we're already behind on the turnaround. management is breathing down my neck about this flight because of the revenue on this route. if it's just a tiny bit of noise in the sensor, can we just monitor it in real-time during the flight instead? could we reasonably argue this is just operational variance?",
