      "content": "To definitively state if the vibrations are outside the standard deviation, I would need access to the historical operational baseline data for Engine 2 on that specific model. Without that established envelope, any assertion of being outside the norm is speculative. If the deviation is minor and falls within established historical noise, the risk argument is weaker, but if it trends consistently above established limits, it is a technical basis for caution.",
